|                        | public.service_visits=5                                                 |
| Ranked aggregates      | Validate at most 500 candidate groups, suppress small cohorts, then     |
|                        | return at most top 25                                                   |
| Query volume           | 1000 queries per trusted scope in a rolling 24-hour window; 120         |
|                        | requests per minute                                                     |
| Disclosure controls    | 4000 extracted cells and 16 differencing variants per rolling 24-hour   |
|                        | window                                                                  |
| Writes                 | None - this boundary is local read-only Explore                         |
+------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+

